Section: 5 Conclusion
Text: 5 Conclusion In this paper, we explored a sifted multi-task learn- ing method with a novel selected sharing structure for fake news detection. The selected sharing struc- ture fused single gate mechanism for ﬁltering use- less shared features and attention mechanism for paying close attention to features that were helpful to target tasks.

Rank: 10
